*** Settings ***
Documentation       Technical helper keywords for desktop programs. Only here are keywords of PlatynUI used.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/abilities/desktop_ability.resource
Variables           ${EXECDIR}/resources/pages/calculator_page.py
Keyword Tags        interaction


*** Keywords ***
Launch Program
    [Documentation]    Starts the program.
    Start Process    ${DESKTOP_PROGRAM}

Wait For Window
    [Documentation]    Waits until the window is visible.
    [Arguments]    ${window}
    Ensure Exists    ${window}    timeout=${TIMEOUT}

Focus Element
    [Documentation]    Clicks an element so that its window receives the keyboard input.
    [Arguments]    ${element}
    Mouse Click    ${element}

Type Into Window
    [Documentation]    Types keys into the window, e.g. "12+30=".
    [Arguments]    ${window}    ${keys}
    Type Keys    ${window}    ${keys}

Read Element Name
    [Documentation]    Reads the label of an element and returns it.
    [Arguments]    ${element}
    ${text}    Get Property Value    ${element}    Name
    RETURN    ${text}

Close Program
    [Documentation]    Ends the program.
    Run Process    taskkill    /IM    ${DESKTOP_PROCESS_NAME}
